  941                                   ; polyo2d
  942                                   ;*****
  943                                   ;*
  944                                   ;* POLYO2D:  Draw 2D object made of polygons, positioned in Tempest 3D space
  945                                   ;*
  946                                   ;* Inputs: IN_BUF+0=Pointer to poly object data structure
  947                                   ;*         +4=X +8=Y +12=Z, Tempest world co-ordinates
  948                                   ;*         +16=X centre; +20=Y centre, as 16:16 fractions; +24=XY Rotation Angle
  949                                   ;*
  950                                   ;*****
  951                                   ; *******************************************************************
  952                                       
  953                                   polyo2d:
  954                                   ;*      Definitions for use in the alternate-register bank. Alternate r0 and ISTART are used in the polyrenderer.
